---
config:
  startOnLoad: false
  theme: base
  htmlLabels: false
  fontFamily: Arial, Microsoft YaHei, Noto Serif CJK SC, sans-serif
  themeVariables:
    fontSize: 16px
    primaryColor: "#e9f2fc"
    primaryBorderColor: "#296bb7"
    primaryTextColor: "#333333"
    lineColor: "#0b0b0b"

  themeCSS: |
    .node text,
    .nodeLabel,
    .label text {
      font-weight: 400;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    .node rect,
    .flowchart-link {
      stroke-width: 1px;
    }
---

flowchart TD
    A["代码慢吗？"]
    B["Profiler 证明瓶颈在哪里了吗？"]
    C["已有高性能 library / operator 能解决吗？"]
    D["torch.compile 能自动 fusion 吗？"]
    E["这个热点是否足够重要、足够稳定？"]
    F["Custom Triton kernel 是否有明确优化空间？"]

    A --> B --> C --> D --> E --> F
